===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*klinъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-клин.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-клин.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+||-ья|adj=клиново́й,кли́нный<q:rare>|dim=кли́нышек}}

# {{topics|ru|Tools|Simple machines}} [[wedge]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[боро́дка]] '''кли́ном'''|'''wedge-shaped''' beard}}
# [[V]] [[formation]] {{q|of birds, aircraft, etc.}}
#: {{syn|ru|кося́к<q:of birds>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[журавли́ный]] '''клин'''|'''V''' of cranes}}
# {{lb|ru|military}} [[flying wedge]]
#: {{syn|ru|свинья́<q:historical>}}
# {{lb|ru|agriculture|countable|or|collective}} [[field]](s) or an [[area]] of a field sown with one [[crop]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[посевно́й]] '''клин'''|sowing '''area'''}}
# {{lb|ru|cloth}} {{topics|ru|Fabrics}} [[gusset]]
# {{lb|ru|architecture}} [[quoin]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''клин''' '''кли́ном''' [[вышибать|вышиба́ют]]|[[like cures like]]}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} [[jam]], [[jam-up]] {{gl|blockage of a mechanism}}
#: {{syn|ru|закли́нивание}}
# {{lb|ru|figurative}} [[stupor]]
#: {{syn|ru|сту́пор}}

